{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":33,"alongside":34,"kin":35,"engines":60,"usedOn":61,"sites":62,"crewed":66,"museums":67,"hero":68},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/jwst.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_sites":28,"tagline":31,"description":32},"jwst","James Webb宇宙望遠鏡","observatory","NASA / ESA","USA / Multi (Europe)","Northrop Grumman / Goddard Space Flight Center","2021-12-25","ACTIVE","2011-now","commercial-era","史上最大の赤外線宇宙望遠鏡；L2軌道","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"James Webb Space Telescope — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/James_Webb_Space_Telescope","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Webb — NASA","https://webb.nasa.gov/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"JWST Mission Documentation (STScI)","https://www.stsci.edu/jwst/about-jwst","deep",[29],{"type":30,"site_id":3},"earth-object","最大の赤外線宇宙望遠鏡；L2軌道","これまでに建造された最大の赤外線宇宙望遠鏡。2022年1月から太陽・地球ラグランジュポイント(L2)に配置されており、テニスコート規模のサンシールドの背後に、6.5 mの分割式金メッキベリリウム主鏡を備えています。ビッグバン直後の最初の銀河まで観測することができます。",[],[],[36,40,44,48,52,56],{"id":37,"name":38,"tagline":39},"hubble","Hubble宇宙望遠鏡","象徴的な可視紫外線宇宙望遠鏡；5回の保守ミッション",{"id":41,"name":42,"tagline":43},"euclid","Euclid","空の3分の1を対象とするダークエネルギー調査",{"id":45,"name":46,"tagline":47},"spektr-rg","Spektr-RG","ロシアとドイツのX線全天マッピング観測衛星",{"id":49,"name":50,"tagline":51},"tess","TESS","全天系外惑星トランジット探査",{"id":53,"name":54,"tagline":55},"hitomi","ひとみ (ASTRO-H)","軌道上で回転して分裂；その喪失がXRISM開発を推進した",{"id":57,"name":58,"tagline":59},"gaia","Gaia","3Dで18億の星をマッピング",[],[],[63],{"type":30,"href":64,"name":4,"place":-1,"text":65},"/earth?id=jwst","日‐地球 L2 ラグランジュ点 — 地球から約 150 万 km。一度もメンテナンスできない。ビッグバンの直後、最初の星と銀河からの光を 134 億年前までさかのぼって見る。建造に 25 年。これまでで最も複雑な科学機器。そして動いている。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/jwst/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
